{{Term/Store|Seared Prime Steak|Seared Prime Steaks|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory">{{Cite|{{Big|Seared Prime Steak}}<br/>Raw prime meat cooked over an open flame. The outside is perfectly browned, while the inside is mouthwateringly juicy.|Inventory|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|{{Big|Seared Prime Steak}}<br/>Prime meat cooked over an open flame. The outside is perfectly browned, while the inside is mouthwateringly juicy.|Inventory|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Seared Prime Steaks are a type of [[Roasted Food]]. [[Link]] can make Seared Prime Steaks by burning [[Raw Prime Meat]]s with a [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> Upon their death, [[Black Hinox]] may also drop this item, and they can be purchased from [[Estan]]'s [[Stall]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. The outsides of Seared Prime Steaks are considered perfectly browned, while their insides are juicy.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Eating one restores two and one quarter of Link's [[Heart]]s.

